     "duration_s": 2
    },
    {
     "type": "narrate",
     "text": "DUMBO sits between two bridges on the Brooklyn shore of the East River. Here is the whole walk we are about to take.",
     "duration_s": 8
    },
    {
     "type": "map_focus",
     "map_span_m": 700,
     "duration_s": 4
    },
    {
     "type": "narrate",
     "text": "We start at the old Fulton Ferry landing, at the bottom left.",
     "duration_s": 5
    },
    {
     "type": "set_mode",
     "mode": "walk",
     "duration_s": 1
    },
    {
     "type": "narrate",
     "text": "Before the Brooklyn Bridge opened in 1883 this landing was the only way across. We are standing directly beneath the bridge that replaced it.",
     "duration_s": 11
    },
    {
     "type": "narrate",
     "text": "Look east along the waterfront and you can see the whole of DUMBO, with the Manhattan Bridge closing off the far end.",
     "duration_s": 8
    },
    {
     "type": "pan",
     "heading_deg": 72,
     "pitch_deg": 4,
     "duration_s": 4
    },
    {
